  "descriptionHtml": "<p><strong>Meet your new favourite fidget.</strong> Squishy™ is the ultra-soft, slow-rise stress squeezie that sinks under your fingers and springs back over five deeply satisfying seconds. Keep one on your desk, in your pocket or in the pencil case for calm on demand.</p><ul><li>🧸 <strong>Slow-rise foam</strong> — squeeze, release, and watch it rise back over ~5 seconds</li><li>💪 <strong>Built to last</strong> — dense, high-rebound foam that survives thousands of squishes</li><li>🌿 <strong>Safe for everyone</strong> — non-toxic, phthalate-free and suitable for ages 3+</li><li>🎁 <strong>The perfect gift</strong> — for birthdays, party bags, stocking fillers and just-because days</li><li>✋ <strong>Palm-sized</strong> — roughly 8 cm, small enough to take anywhere</li></ul><p><em>Bundle &amp; save: any 2 Squishies for £16.99 or mix and match any 3 for just £19.99 — applied automatically at checkout!</em></p>",
